      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I did not see Vive advanced controls until now. When enabled, the movements are indeed better.\nThe joystick works here much better than touchpad, btw. Because with your thumb on touchpad, the speed is not always good if you touch it with wide part of thumb. You need touch it with small area (pointing) so faster walk is possible.\nBut joystick is much easier with thumb!\nThanks, my problem is solved here.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
